    "updated_at": "2020-08-14T15:21:19Z",
    "body": "What if the dynamic import isn't at the top level?\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\nsetTimeout(() => console.log('loading'), 1000);\r\nsetTimeout(() => {\r\n    import('./slow-script-taking-2sec-to-load.js').then(() => console.log('imported'));\r\n}, 10000);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe spec makes more sense to me than whatever the browsers are doing.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
