    "created_at": "2020-09-09T09:56:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-09T09:56:48Z",
    "body": "> What if the dynamic import isn't at the top level?\r\n\r\nIn that case, dynamic import doesn't affect window load event, because window load event was already fired (just after `<script>`) when dynamic import starts (10 sec after `<script>`).\r\n\r\nI think this is similar to e.g. `<img>`: if `<img src=\"image-2sec-to-load.png\">` is inserted before window load event then it delays window load event for 2 seconds, while if it is inserted after window load event it doesn't impact window load event.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/689458932/reactions",
