    "created_at": "2020-11-30T13:37:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-11-30T13:37:25Z",
    "body": "Why does `loading` happen before the main `load` event in Chromium? @codehag is planning on aligning Firefox with the specification for `import()` at least (to not make that block the main `load` event).",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
