    "created_at": "2022-06-02T01:30:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-02T01:30:21Z",
    "body": "> Why does `loading` happen before the main `load` event in Chromium?\r\n\r\nThis was because Chromium delays the load event until (1) network loading completion but not until (2) the promise resolution, and the window load event is fired between (1) and (2).\r\n\r\nAnd I found I changed the Chromium behavior by https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/3508111 (unintentionally as a part of fixing another bug), and the current Chrome canary does *not* delay the load event for dynamic imports.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
